o do you think that because we've talked previously do you think that because this is a new relationship that some feelings um could come up that you really don't or some actions from him can come up that you really haven't seen and maybe you know because we're all human we all have feelings do you think this is a side of him you've never seen before and that's why you're you know reacting in a sense that you know you're confused yeah because he's never showed you this side is that maybe the reason why your feelings are yeah coming about you know i think that's exactly it and you know i really shouldn't be shocked because it hasn't been that long like you said and you never truly know a person and you have to see a person when they're mad when they're stressed when they're sleep deprived and i haven't seen him in all those situations and now i'm seeing him in this and you don't like it and i don't like it okay so what do you wish he would have said that would not put you in a place of betrayal or frustration or confusion like how do you think the situation could have played out to not have you feeling the way you do now if he would have called me first okay and re like said hey i know that i'm supposed to be there but i'm really busy i i can't make it tonight i'm sorry that's we would not be here okay so if he would have just i guess taking a moment and just explain the situation before um i guess or just explain you know himself so you can know have a peace of mind that i understand where you're coming from and i want to help and because he didn't do that you're in a position where you you don't know the situation you don't know how you really feel so i think that in all situations like you really don't know where somebody is coming or who somebody is unless you have a long period of time to get to know them and get to understand them and who they are and what they feel and what makes them mad what makes them sad what makes them happy and vice versa so i think that