1948: 
1949: **confl icts begin to surface from the depths of the unconscious. Clients regress** **emotionally. Some of their feelings arise from confl icts such as trust versus** **mistrust, love versus hate, dependence versus independence, and autonomy versus shame and guilt. Transference takes place when clients resurrect from**
